<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BZW lowers Boots to &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BZW lowers Boots to &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boots Co Plc was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at BZW on Friday, market sources said.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock, which reached a record 823p on Thursday -- up 37 percent since the end of 1996 -- was up two pence at 793-1/2 by 0914 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
